# Same format as .gitignore. Everything here stays out of the deploy.
#
# Nothing in this list is fetched at runtime: no .js or .html file in src/ or at
# the root references r.xml, and the only runtime fetches in the whole game are
# assets/cars/manifest.json, assets/materials/atlas.json, assets/radio/playlist.json
# and the per-car skin.json files.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.assetsignore
wrangler.toml
package.json
node_modules
tools/
docs/
gemini-inbox/
r.xml
*.md
*.sh
*.py
